{'symbol': 'IQV', 'date': '2022-08-15 07:30:00', 'title': "IQVIA WINS SNOWFLAKE'S “MARKETPLACE HEALTHCARE AND LIFE SCIENCES PARTNER OF THE YEAR” AWARD", 'text': "RESEARCH TRIANGLE PARK, N.C.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--IQVIA (NYSE:IQV), A LEADING GLOBAL PROVIDER OF ADVANCED ANALYTICS, TECHNOLOGY SOLUTIONS AND CONTRACT SERVICES TO THE LIFE SCIENCES INDUSTRY, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS BEEN NAMED THE 2022 MARKETPLACE HEALTHCARE AND LIFE SCIENCES PARTNER OF THE YEAR BY SNOWFLAKE, THE DATA CLOUD COMPANY. IQVIA WAS RECOGNIZED FOR ITS ACHIEVEMENTS IN LEVERAGING THE SNOWFLAKE DATA CLOUD FOR IQVIA'S DATA-AS-A-SERVICE (DAAS) SOLUTION, GIVING CUSTOMERS QUICK ACCESS TO SEARCHAB"}